INSERT INTO RAW.EMAIL_MESSAGE (message_id, ticket_id, customer_id, customer_email, direction, from_address, to_address, subject, body, thread_position, sent_at) VALUES
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260911-6-3', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260911-6', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'This is the third time I am writing.

It has now been well past the 48 hours you quoted. The hospital is asking me to settle in cash and claim reimbursement later, which defeats the entire purpose of a cashless policy that I have paid INR 45,000 a year for.

I want a written explanation of the delay and the name of the officer handling this. If I do not receive the approval today I will be raising this with the IRDAI grievance cell.

Amit Patel', 3, '2026-09-14 20:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260911-6-4', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260911-6', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'Cashless pre-authorisation delay', 'Dear Amit,

We acknowledge the delay and sincerely regret the inconvenience. Ticket TKT-INS-1003-20260911-6 has been marked urgent and assigned to a senior claims officer.

We will revert within 24 hours.

Regards,
Customer Service', 4, '2026-09-15 00:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260920-7-1', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260920-7', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Deficiency letter — documents already submitted', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

I have received a deficiency letter on claim CLM-3006 asking for the same documents I have already uploaded twice — the discharge summary and the final bill.

This is the second deficiency letter on the same claim. Each time the clock appears to restart. Please confirm what is genuinely outstanding so I can close this once.

Regards,
Amit Patel', 1, '2026-09-20 17:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260920-7-2', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260920-7', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'Deficiency letter — documents already submitted', 'Dear Amit,

Ticket TKT-INS-1003-20260920-7 refers. We have asked the TPA to reconcile the documents received against the deficiency raised and revert.

Regards,
Claims Support', 2, '2026-09-21 23:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8-1', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

I have received the renewal notice for policy POL-5004. The premium has been revised upward substantially from the previous year.

I would like a written explanation of how this revision has been calculated. As per IRDAI guidelines, premium revision must be based on the approved rate chart for the product and not on individual claims history alone.

Please share the basis of this revision.

Regards,
Amit Patel', 1, '2026-08-29 18:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8-2', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'Dear Amit,

Thank you for your mail, logged as ticket TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8.

Premium revisions are applied at the product level and reflect portfolio claims experience and medical inflation. We are arranging for an underwriter to walk you through the calculation.

Regards,
Customer Service', 2, '2026-08-30 20:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8-3', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260829-8', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Premium revision at renewal — justification requested', 'I have not received the written justification I asked for.

I have obtained a comparable quote from another insurer which is materially lower for the same sum insured. I have been with you for several years with a clean record.

Please treat this as a formal request for the justification. I am also enquiring about portability, since the renewal date is approaching.

Amit Patel', 3, '2026-09-03 18:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260926-9-1', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260926-9', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Portability procedure enquiry', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

Please share the portability procedure and the required forms for policy POL-5004.

I understand that under IRDAI portability regulations I need to apply at least 45 days before renewal, and that accrued continuity benefits and waiting periods carry over to the new insurer. Please confirm my accrued no-claim bonus and the waiting periods already served, as I will need these for the proposal.

Regards,
Amit Patel', 1, '2026-09-26 19:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260926-9-2', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260926-9', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'Portability procedure enquiry', 'Dear Amit,

We are sorry to see this request. Ticket TKT-INS-1003-20260926-9 has been raised and routed to our retention desk, who will contact you before issuing the portability documentation.

Regards,
Customer Service', 2, '2026-09-27 13:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260917-10-1', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260917-10', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Auto-debit mandate not honoured', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

The auto-debit for policy POL-5004 has not been presented this month. I have not cancelled the mandate from my side and my account has sufficient balance.

Please confirm the mandate is still active. I do not want the policy to lapse over a banking issue.

Regards,
Amit Patel', 1, '2026-09-17 20:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1003-20260917-10-2', 'TKT-INS-1003-20260917-10', 'INS-1003', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'OUTBOUND', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'amit.patel@hotmail.com', 'Auto-debit mandate not honoured', 'Dear Amit,

Ticket TKT-INS-1003-20260917-10 refers. We are checking the NACH mandate status with our banking partner and will confirm within two working days.

Regards,
Finance Support', 2, '2026-09-19 06:00:00'),
('EM-TKT-INS-1004-20210310-0-1', 'TKT-INS-1004-20210310-0', 'INS-1004', 'deepika.singh@gmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'deepika.singh@gmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Policy document / 80D certificate request', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

