('EM-TKT-INS-1004-20230512-2-1', 'TKT-INS-1004-20230512-2', 'INS-1004', 'deepika.singh@gmail.com', 'INBOUND', 'deepika.singh@gmail.com', 'support@bharatsuraksha.co.in', 'Network hospital delisted', 'Dear Sir/Madam,

